---
// Audience.astro - Linear Style
---

<section class="section audience-section" id="audience">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">Target Builders</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Engineered for Teams Who Value Speed, Cost & Autonomy</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Eliminate DevOps friction whether you are building your first SaaS or scaling a dozen production client services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Audience Bento Grid -->
    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Persona 1: Startups & SMBs -->
      <div class="bento-card persona-bento">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="linear-pill pill-glow-purple">🏢 Cut Cloud Bills</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Startups & SMBs</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          Run your entire backend, databases, and microservices on high-performance $10 - $40 VPS servers. 
          Save up to <strong>80% on cloud bills</strong> without hiring a full-time DevOps engineer.
        </p>
        <div class="persona-perks">
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>No surprise cloud billing surges</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>100% GDPR & HIPAA compliance ready</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>High availability Docker Swarm clustering</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Persona 2: Solo Devs & Indie Hackers -->
      <div class="bento-card persona-bento card-highlight-amber">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="linear-pill pill-glow-amber">👨‍💻 Most Popular</span>
          <span class="badge-accent-tag">Solo Builders</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Solo Devs & Indie Hackers</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          Ship fast, test ideas with instant preview links, and host 20+ side projects on a single $5/month VPS. 
          Manage databases, cron jobs, and domains from one central dashboard.
        </p>
        <div class="persona-perks">
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>1-Click Postgres, MySQL, Redis, ClickHouse</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>Automatic Let's Encrypt HTTPS / SSL</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>In-browser container file & terminal manager</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Persona 3: Software Agencies & Teams -->
      <div class="bento-card persona-bento">
        <div class="bento-badge-row">
          <span class="linear-pill pill-glow-emerald">👥 Client Delivery</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="bento-title">Software Agencies</h3>
        <p class="bento-text">
          Manage isolated client environments with zero hassle. Spin up ephemeral preview environments for client reviews, 
          and deliver clean Docker Swarm setups without proprietary lock-in.
        </p>
        <div class="persona-perks">
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>Ephemeral PR previews for client sign-offs</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>Isolated dev / staging / prod environments</span></div>
          <div class="perk-item"><span class="perk-check">✓</span><span>Effortless client handoff with pure Docker</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .persona-bento {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-highlight-amber {
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06) 0%, rgba(12, 16, 24, 0.8) 100%);
  }

  .persona-perks {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .perk-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .perk-check {
    color: var(--accent-amber);
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
</style>
